{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DmRRJdWtWEEx1NnfcaMGcS","type":"tool_result","content":"- index: 0\n  title: srd002-sys -- pkg/sys (contract)\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd002-sys.yaml (full SRD for pkg/sys)\n      - CLAUDE.md (SIGPIPE handling pattern and project conventions)\n\n    files:\n      - path: pkg/sys/fileinfo.go\n        action: create\n        note: FileInfo struct and Stat/Lstat function stubs\n      - path: pkg/sys/terminal.go\n        action: create\n        note: TerminalWidth and IsTerminal function stubs\n      - path: pkg/sys/signal.go\n        action: create\n        note: InstallSIGPIPEHandler and OnTerminalResize function stubs\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Define FileInfo struct with fields: Mode os.FileMode, Size int64, Nlink uint64, Uid uint32, Gid uint32, Rdev uint64, Dev uint64, Ino uint64, Blocks int64, Blksize int64, ModTime time.Time, AccessTime time.Time, ChangeTime time.Time, Info os.FileInfo\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Define file metadata function signatures as stubs: Stat(path string) (*FileInfo, error), Lstat(path string) (*FileInfo, error)\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Define terminal function signatures as stubs: TerminalWidth() (int, error), IsTerminal(fd uintptr) bool\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Define signal function signatures as stubs: InstallSIGPIPEHandler(), OnTerminalResize(callback func(width int))\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Split exports across three files by domain: fileinfo.go (struct and stat functions), terminal.go (terminal queries), signal.go (signal handlers)\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Package must not import any cmd/ package or any other pkg/ package\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Stub functions must compile on Darwin -- use placeholder return values (nil, zero, etc.) so go build passes\"\n\n    